/*
 * merlin_model_runner: load a Merlin-compiled VMFB on a FireSim Shuttle hart,
 * run the model on zero-filled input, hash the output, print cycle counts.
 *
 * Configured at build time:
 *   -DMERLIN_MODEL_<NAME>   (one of MLP_WIDE / DRONET / YOLOV8N)
 *   -DMERLIN_BACKEND="<str>"   (scalar | rvv | opu | gemmini, log-only)
 *   -DMERLIN_HART=<0|1>     (hart to pin onto)
 *   -DMERLIN_NEEDS_VECTOR=<0|1>  (if 1, set mstatus.VS=Dirty before invoking)
 *
 * The embedded VMFB is supplied via merlin_vmfb.h (generated by `xxd -i`).
 * Background:
 *   - SMP setup (DT overlay, prj.conf) follows samples/gemmini_opu_test/.
 *   - mstatus.VS=Dirty preamble per lesson 4 of
 *     docs/dev_blog/2026-05-13-zephyr-on-hetero-shuttle-firesim.md.
 *   - IREE call sequence mirrors samples/iree/simple_embedding/.
 *
 * SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
 */

